sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Kullanici
    participant W as /randevu sayfasi
    participant S as Slim API
    participant E as SlotEngine
    participant P as PostgREST
    U->>W: Tarih + personel sec
    W->>S: GET /api/available-slots
    S->>P: working_hours + time_off + gunluk appointments
    P-->>S: satirlar
    S->>E: getAvailableSlots()
    E-->>S: musait slotlar
    S-->>W: 200 + slots[]
    U->>W: Slot sec + KVKK onayi
    W->>S: POST /api/appointments
    S->>S: TR telefon + tarih formati kontrol
    S->>P: idempotency kontrol + insert
    P-->>S: confirmation_code
    S-->>W: 200 + kod
